# 2026 Research Lab — editor guardrails (legacy pointer)

**Canonical agent contract:** [`AGENTS.md`](./AGENTS.md)  
**Human map:** [`docs/agent-os/README.md`](./docs/agent-os/README.md)  
**Cursor rules:** [`.cursor/rules/`](./.cursor/rules/)

This file remains so older tooling that still reads `.cursorrules` finds a pointer.
Do not duplicate policy here — edit `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/rules/` instead.

## Quick reminders

- Nix + `uv` (per app); no durable `pip install`.
- Apps in `/apps/<name>`; shared in `/modules`.
- PydanticAI schema-first; type hints on all signatures.
- Spec → Plan → Packet → Implement (`specs/`, `notes/packets/`).
